# Build products — never committed (see AGENTS.md §2).
# Only the root compiler binary is ignored by name; ctc.c itself stays tracked.
/ctc
*.o
a.out

# Generated C for the examples: each example dir carries only <name>.ct and
# <name>.expected.out. Note that test/cases/*.expected.c and *.expected.h are
# golden fixtures on purpose — do NOT add a global *.c / *.h rule.
examples/*/*.c
examples/*/*.h

# Editor and OS junk
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# VS Code extension packaging output (editors/vscode)
*.vsix
editors/**/node_modules/

# Local agent tooling (skills, caches) — not part of the shipped project
.trae/
